          },
          {
            "x": 2.178649237472767,
            "y": 12.910611231371064,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Historical Context</strong><br>\nThe conflict between Israel and Palestine has a long history, dating back to the early 20th century. Various wars and disputes have shaped the relations between the two peoples. The main points of contention are land ownership, borders, and political control.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Current Political Situation</strong><br>\nThe current political situation is characterized by disagreement and tensions. While Israel has strong political and military power, the Palestinians strive for international recognition and an independent state. The political leadership on both sides often has differing views on the path to peace.</p>\n\n<p><strong>International Interventions</strong><br>\nInternational interventions and mediations have attempted to find a solution for the conflict in the past. The United Nations, the USA, and other countries have made peace proposals, but a lasting solution has not yet been achieved.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
        "slideBackgroundSelector": {}
      },
      {
        "elements": [
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
