          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Economic Factors</strong><br>\nThe economy of both territories is severely affected by the ongoing conflict. Lasting peace could improve the economic situation and attract investments, which in turn could raise the standard of living for the population.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Education and Culture</strong><br>\nEducation and cultural exchange can help break down prejudices and foster understanding between communities. Projects that promote dialogue and joint learning could have a positive impact on the peace process.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Humanitarian Aspects</strong><br>\nThe humanitarian situation, particularly in Palestinian territories, is of concern. Improved access to basic services, healthcare, and education is crucial for improving living conditions and can contribute to stability in the region.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
