            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Security Concerns</strong><br>\nSecurity concerns are high on both sides, with regular incidents of violence and terrorist attacks. Improving the security situation is crucial for building trust and promoting peace.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Public Opinion</strong><br>\nPublic opinion and societal attitudes can influence the peace process. Peace initiatives and movements within societies can put pressure on political leaders to take constructive steps towards peace.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Future Prospects</strong><br>\nThe chances for lasting peace depend on many factors, including the willingness of both sides to compromise and cooperate. With international support and societal engagement, positive steps could be made towards a more peaceful future.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
